<div id="u-credit-00034-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4516971&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606028275" alt="Rachud" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4516971)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rachud" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4516971); return false;">Rachud</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1586172967 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Apr 2020 11:36</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
